`src/asm/sha512-cryptogams.s` are generated from CRYPTOGAMS
(https://github.com/dot-asm/cryptogams, `x86_64/sha512-x86_64.pl` at commit
4acc4a308eab6049d1cf1c7ba61b353a36ce0e2d), written by Andy Polyakov. The
